      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "Enable HIDS on the server",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Log in with an administrative account",
        "is_correct": false
      }
    ],
    "suggested_answers": [
      "B"
    ],
    "answers": [
      "B-Boot from Media is the correct answer\nFirmware updates (such as BIOS or the Unified Extensible Firmware Interface [UEFI]) may be required prior to installation, even for indirect reasons, such as network Preboot Execution Environment (PXE) boot, USB device boot support, and so on. If you plan on installing the hypervisor from a DVD or USB, you may also have to change the boot order configuration on your machine."
    ],
