        "is_correct": false
      }
    ],
    "suggested_answers": [
      "A"
    ],
    "answers": [
      "SAS SSD",
      "Comparison of the three DAS implementations:\n- SATA when cost is more important than performance, less need for scalability\n- SAS to balance cost and performance, scalability\n- NVMe when performance is more important than cost, especially on servers that see large file transfers\nRef. The Official CompTIA Server+ Study Guide (Exam SK0-005) page 112."
