      "Training. How would enforcing social media help anything?",
      "User awareness and training is the number one defense against most\nsecurity threats. Chapter 6 discussed social engineering and user awareness\nregarding network malware attacks.\nReference: All in-one CompTIA Server+ Certification Exam Guide SK0-005",
      "B is correct answer"
