    "answers": [
      "B. Examine the DNS to see if the new server record exists. Obvious answer for me, can't make any sense of other options.",
      "Stupid question. Not enough information to make a choice. DHCP may or may not be giving correct DNS information in scope. DNS entry may or may not be configured. This is open to interpretation. I am choosing B because I am assuming DHCP scope is correct.",
      "A keyword is \"All the user workstations receive their IP information from a DHCP server.\"",
