      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "The HBA",
        "is_correct": false
      }
    ],
    "suggested_answers": [
      "B"
    ],
    "answers": [
      "B. The BIOS\n\nWhen installing a new CPU, technicians should update the BIOS.\nBy updating the BIOS, it is expected that the new CPU will be properly recognized and the system will operate correctly.",
      "B. The BIOS"
