        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Some modules are not compatible.",
        "is_correct": true
      }
    ],
    "suggested_answers": [
      "D"
    ],
    "answers": [
      "D. Some modules are not compatible."
    ],
    "url": "https://www.examtopics.com/discussions/comptia/view/135828-exam-sk0-005-topic-1-question-238-discussion/"
  },
  {
    "exam_code": "sk0-005",
    "topic": 1,
    "question_num": 239,
    "question": "An application server cannot communicate with a newly installed database server. The database server, which has static IP information, is reading the following output from ipconfig:\n\n\nIP: 10.0.10.240 -\n\nMask: 255.255.255.128 -\n\nGateway: 10.0.10.1 -\n\nThe application server is reading the following output from ipconfig:\n\n\nIP: 10.0.10.25 -\n\nMask: 255.255.255.128 -\n\nGateway: 10.0.10.1 -\n\nWhich of the following MOST likely contains an error?",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
        "text": "IP address",
        "is_correct": true
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "DHCP",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "Gateway",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Subnet mask",
        "is_correct": false
      }
    ],
    "suggested_answers": [
      "A"
    ],
    "answers": [
      "Another very poorly thought out question, it can be either the IP or the subnet mask. If you change the mask to /24 that also resolves the access issue. Answer is A because presumably they carved out this subnet for a reason but that should be explained in the question IMO.",
      "A. IP address\n\nboth the database server and the application server are configured with IP addresses in the same subnet (10.0.10.0/25) and the same subnet mask (255.255.255.128), and they have the same default gateway (10.0.10.1), which indicates they are on the same network segment.\n\nThe issue is most likely related to the IP address configuration, as the database server has the IP address 10.0.10.240, while the application server has the IP address 10.0.10.25. Since the subnet mask is 255.255.255.128 (which corresponds to a subnet with addresses ranging from 10.0.10.0 to 10.0.10.127), the database server's IP address (10.0.10.240) is outside the valid range for the subnet. This suggests that there may have been a mistake in configuring the IP address of the database server.\n\nTo resolve the issue, the database server's IP address should be corrected to a valid address within the subnet range, such as 10.0.10.2 to 10.0.10.126, considering the subnet mask of 255.255.255.128.",
      "The database has\nIP: 10.0.10.240 - Mask: 255.255.255.128 - Gateway: 10.0.10.1 -\nThis mask gives two subnets 10.0.10.0/25 and 10.0.10.128/25 so the ip address and the gateway are on different subnets.\n\nThe Application Server is on\nIP: 10.0.10.25 - Mask: 255.255.255.128 - Gateway: 10.0.10.1 -\nThe IP address and gateway are on the same subnet.\nSo the answer is an incorrect IP address on the database server"
    ],
    "url": "https://www.examtopics.com/discussions/comptia/view/117586-exam-sk0-005-topic-1-question-239-discussion/"
  },
  {
    "exam_code": "sk0-005",
    "topic": 1,
    "question_num": 240,
    "question": "A technician is setting up a small office that consists of five Windows 10 computers. The technician has been asked to use a simple IP configuration without manually adding any IP addresses. Which of the following will the technician MOST likely use for the IP address assignment?",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Static",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "Router-assigned",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "APIPA",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "DHCP",
        "is_correct": true
      }
    ],
    "suggested_answers": [
      "D"
    ],
    "answers": [
      "Going with (C) APIPA: Automatic IP Addressing\nIt's a feature used by Windows-based operating systems to automatically assign an IP address when a DHCP server is unavailable. Since the question specified Windows computers and there was no mention of a server to implement DHCP on, this would be the most simple and automated route."
    ],
    "url": "https://www.examtopics.com/discussions/comptia/view/153738-exam-sk0-005-topic-1-question-240-discussion/"
  },
  {
    "exam_code": "sk0-005",
    "topic": 1,
    "question_num": 241,
    "question": "Ann, an administrator, has been troubleshooting a server issue. She carefully questioned the users and examined the available logs. Using this information, she was able to rule out several possible causes and develop a theory as to what the issue might be. Through further testing, her theory proved to be correct. Which of the following should be the NEXT step to troubleshoot the issue?",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Document the findings and actions.",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "Escalate the issue to the management team.",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "Implement the solution.",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Establish an action plan",
        "is_correct": true
      }
    ],
    "suggested_answers": [
      "D"
    ],
    "answers": [
      "'NEXT' step would be to establish a plan of action.\nIdentify the problem.\nResearch.\nEstablish a theory of probable cause.\nTest the theory.\nEstablish a plan of action.\nImplement or escalate.\nVerify functionality.\nDocument the solution.",
      "What are the 7 troubleshooting steps from CompTIA?\nStandard troubleshooting steps\nIdentify the problem.\nResearch.\nEstablish a theory of probable cause.\nTest the theory.\nEstablish a plan of action.\nImplement or escalate.\nVerify functionality.\nDocument the solution.",
      "C. Implement the solution"
    ],
    "url": "https://www.examtopics.com/discussions/comptia/view/114236-exam-sk0-005-topic-1-question-241-discussion/"
  },
  {
    "exam_code": "sk0-005",
    "topic": 1,
    "question_num": 242,
    "question": "Which of the following script types would MOST likely be used on a modern Windows server OS?",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
