        "is_correct": true
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Connect the virtual administration console.",
        "is_correct": false
      }
    ],
    "suggested_answers": [
      "C"
    ],
    "answers": [
      "C. Connect to the server from a crash cart.",
      "C. Connect to the server from a crash cart.\nWhat i usually do first to investigate. From here i go to Putty or SMTK if problem is more complex."
