    "exam_code": "sk0-005",
    "topic": 1,
    "question_num": 295,
    "question": "A company wants to find an affordable way to simulate a fail over of a critical application. The company does not currently have a solution for it. The application consists of 15 servers, and the company would like to simulate on production configurations and IP address schemes. Which of the following would be the most cost-effective solution?",
