  {
    "exam_code": "sk0-005",
    "topic": 1,
    "question_num": 309,
    "question": "A new virtual server was deployed in a perimeter network. Users have reported the time on the server has been incorrect. The engineer has verified the configuration, and the internal time servers are configured properly. Which of the following should the engineer do to resolve this issue?",
    "options": [
      {
