  {
    "exam_code": "sk0-005",
    "topic": 1,
    "question_num": 376,
    "question": "An administrator is able to ping the default gateway and internet sites by name from a file server. The file server is not able to ping the print server by name. The administrator is able to ping the file server from the print server by both IP address and computer name. When initiating an nslookup from the file server for the print server, a different IP address is returned. Which of the following is most likely the cause?",
    "options": [
      {
