  {
    "exam_code": "sk0-005",
    "topic": 1,
    "question_num": 410,
    "question": "An administrator is working on improving the security of a new domain controller. A report indicates several open ports on the server. Which of the following ports should the administrator disable?",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
        "text": "135",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "636",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "3268",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "3389",
        "is_correct": true
      }
    ],
    "suggested_answers": [
      "D"
    ],
    "answers": [
      "D is the correct answer\nSince all other ports are required to be open for the domain controller functions.\n135 - Needed for client server applications that use LDAP/LDAPS authentication\n636 - Used for LDAPS authentication for the Single-Sign-On\n3268 - Used for Global Catalog service to identify other Domain controller in same domain or forest.\n\nPort 3389 is used for remote desktop connection and can be closed due to security reason, Active directory can be viewed/ managed by dsa.msc and RSAT tool on client machine and GPO can also be managed by GPMC.",
      "D would be the best answer here, although if I'm working in the DC everyday all day my choice is RSAT over RDP but I guess one is more secure than the other depending."
    ],
    "url": "https://www.examtopics.com/discussions/comptia/view/150643-exam-sk0-005-topic-1-question-410-discussion/"
  },
  {
    "exam_code": "sk0-005",
    "topic": 1,
    "question_num": 411,
    "question": "A server administrator notices drive C on a critical server does not have any available space, but plenty of unallocated space is left on the disk. Which of the following should the administrator perform to address the availability issue while minimizing downtime?",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Decrease the size of the page/swap file.",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "Reformat drive C to use all the disk space.",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "Enable whole disk encryption on the hard drive.",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Enforce disk quotas on shares within that server.",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "E",
        "text": "Partition the unallocated space to provide more available space.",
        "is_correct": true
      }
    ],
    "suggested_answers": [
      "E"
