  {
    "exam_code": "sk0-005",
    "topic": 1,
    "question_num": 427,
    "question": "A server administrator installs a new OS on two physical servers and then adds them to the network. According to the security policy, flash drives are not allowed on the network. Which of the following types of media will the administrator most likely use? (Choose two.)",
    "options": [
      {
