        "text": "Optical",
        "is_correct": true
      },
      {
        "letter": "B",
        "text": "Embedded",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "C",
        "text": "VM cloning",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "D",
        "text": "PXE",
        "is_correct": true
      },
      {
        "letter": "E",
        "text": "USB",
        "is_correct": false
      },
      {
        "letter": "F",
        "text": "FTP",
        "is_correct": false
      }
    ],
    "suggested_answers": [
      "A",
      "D"
    ],
    "answers": [
      "A & D are the only two that both align with the security policy and can be utilized before being imaged/added to the domain.",
      "A. Optical\nB. Embedded",
      "Correction.\n\nA. Optical\nD. PXE\n\nEmbedded -> Not suitable as it is a “install a new OS” scenario..."
    ],
